    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/116acc6d-c3ed-4635-81e0-bc1365245017-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 110px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CS</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d1bec61a-e4d5-4e89-ae36-7353eb7b5802-image.png\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 119px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/871dc4ce-2b3f-4687-ac4a-b9b19a44f42e-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 149px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/04f8eef3-8007-44a7-99e0-9dc0be87e087-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 149px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CHCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Question: Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
